rine Flotilla of the Royal Navy and used for patrol missions in the North Sea. The Orzeł participated in the Norwegian Campaign where it managed to sink a German troop transport ship, killing hundreds of German troops on their way to invade Norway. A few weeks later, during its seventh patrol in May 1940, the submarine went missing and was presumed sunk.","LocalizedString":"ORP Orzeł was a submarine serving in the Polish Navy during WWII and is best known for the Orzeł incident, where it escaped capture from Estonia during the Soviet occupation of the Baltics in 1939. The crew sailed the ship to the United Kingdom where it was eventually brought into the service of the 2nd Submarine Flotilla of the Royal Navy and used for patrol missions in the North Sea. The Orzeł participated in the Norwegian Campaign where it managed to sink a German troop transport ship, killing hundreds of German troops on their way to invade Norway. A few weeks later, during its seventh patrol in May 1940, the submarine went missing and was presumed sunk."},"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Uncommon","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Legions","isInPermanentPool":true,"cipher":1,"exileNation":"EFactionEnum::Britain","soundEnterPlay":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'AU_Order_UBoat_04'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Orders/U_Boat/AU_Order_UBoat_04.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Poland/Mini_campaign_candidates/t_orp_orzel.t_orp_orzel","SubPathString":""},"artist":"Jarosław Wróbel","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/ORP_ORZEL.ORP_ORZEL","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":356.0},"historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_poland","Key":"card_event_orp_orzel_photo","SourceString":"ORP Orzeł, Gdansk, Poland, 1939.","LocalizedString":"ORP Orzeł, Gdansk, Poland, 1939."},"OnAttackVisualsSoft":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Blueprints/Effects/BP_AttackOrder.BP_AttackOrder_C","SubPathString":""},"Notes":"Image needed to be customized","isDefenseB